{"title":"Conda","date":"2026-05-25T02:05:42.795Z","source":"_posts/Conda.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Conda\ncategories: [RD]\n---\n\n\nConda为一个包含科学计算的Python虚拟环境\n\n\n\n```shell\n# 创建虚拟环境\nconda create -n myenv python=3.9\n\n# 激活虚拟环境\nconda activate myenv\n\n# 删除虚拟环境\nconda remove -n myenv --all\n\n# 查看当前虚拟环境列表\nconda env list\n```\n\n","slug":"Conda","published":true,"updated":"2026-05-25T02:05:42.795Z","_id":"cuid_usJvBrQeQoV6DH4xUB6V","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<p>Conda为一个包含科学计算的Python虚拟环境</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">创建虚拟环境</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">conda create -n myenv python=3.9</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">激活虚拟环境</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">conda activate myenv</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">删除虚拟环境</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">conda remove -n myenv --all</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">查看当前虚拟环境列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">conda env list</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>Conda为一个包含科学计算的Python虚拟环境</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell